### Kich ban demo GridSmart theo vai tro (BE-31)
### Dung voi VS Code REST Client hoac Visual Studio. Mat khau mau o moi truong Development: GridSmart@2026
@host = http://localhost:5282
@password = GridSmart@2026

### 0. Suc khoe he thong
GET {{host}}/health

### ============ CONG DAN (khong can dang nhap) ============

### 1. Danh muc su co
GET {{host}}/api/public/categories

### 2. Xac nhan vi tri truoc khi gui
GET {{host}}/api/public/locate?lat=10.955&lon=106.805

### 3. Gui phan anh (multipart). Doi duong dan anh cho phu hop.
# @name report
POST {{host}}/api/public/incidents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=GridSmartBoundary

--GridSmartBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="latitude"

10.955
--GridSmartBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="longitude"

106.805
--GridSmartBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Có ổ gà lớn giữa đường
--GridSmartBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="reporterPhone"

0911000001
--GridSmartBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample-photo.jpg
--GridSmartBoundary--

### 4. Tra cuu tien do bang ma + so dien thoai
GET {{host}}/api/public/track?code={{report.response.body.trackingCode}}&phone=0911000001

### 5. Danh gia sau khi xu ly xong
POST {{host}}/api/public/incidents/{{report.response.body.trackingCode}}/rating
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "0911000001", "rating": 5, "feedback": "Xử lý nhanh" }

### ============ CAN BO O LUOI (officer02 phu trach Khu pho 2, P. Tran Bien) ============

# @name officerLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "officer02", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@officerToken = {{officerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6. Viec cua toi (sap theo han SLA)
# @name myJobs
GET {{host}}/api/officer/incidents
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

### 7. Nhan viec
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/{{myJobs.response.body.$[0].id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}

### 8. Nghiem thu bang anh After tai hien truong
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/{{myJobs.response.body.$[0].id}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{officerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=GridSmartBoundary

--GridSmartBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="latitude"

10.9551
--GridSmartBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="longitude"

106.8051
--GridSmartBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="note"

Đã vá ổ gà
--GridSmartBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="after.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample-photo.jpg
--GridSmartBoundary--

### ============ DIEU PHOI VIEN (cap tinh) ============

# @name dispatcherLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "dispatcher01", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@dispatcherToken = {{dispatcherLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 9. Hang cho duyet
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?isManualReview=true&status=NEW
Authorization: Bearer {{dispatcherToken}}

### 10. Can bo trong pham vi de chon khi dieu phoi
GET {{host}}/api/officers?gridId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{dispatcherToken}}

### ============ LANH DAO (cap tinh) ============

# @name leaderLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "leader.tinh", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@leaderToken = {{leaderLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 11. Tong quan dieu hanh
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

### 12. Ban do o luoi (GeoJSON, mau trang thai)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/grid-status
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

### 13. Heatmap 30 ngay
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/heatmap
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

### 14. Bao cao theo phuong va KPI can bo
GET {{host}}/api/reports/by-unit
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/reports/officer-kpi
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

### 15. Xuat Excel KPI
GET {{host}}/api/reports/export?type=officer-kpi&format=xlsx
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

### ============ QUAN TRI HE THONG ============

# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 16. Cay don vi hanh chinh
GET {{host}}/api/admin-units/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 17. Vai tro va quyen
GET {{host}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 18. Tua nhanh SLA de demo leo thang (chi moi truong Demo)
POST {{host}}/api/demo/incidents/1/fast-forward?minutes=200
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
